    <briefdescription>
<para>RAII guard that partitions a <ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1sharding_1_1fi__test_1_1_sim_participant" kindref="compound">SimParticipant</ref> on construction and un-partitions it on destruction. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Modelled after std::lock_guard to ensure the participant is always restored even if an exception is thrown during the guarded block. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
